            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"# Rollout order\\n\\nRollout note 1: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 2: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 3: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 4: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 5: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 6: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 7: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 8: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 9: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 10: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 11: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 12: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 13: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 14: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 15: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 16: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 17: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 18: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 19: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 20: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 21: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 22: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 23: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 24: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 25: the ledger and